Argon Plus is a fork of two packages from the OpenWrt luci feed
(openwrt-25.12 branch), merged into one:

  * themes/luci-theme-argon
    Copyright (C) 2008-2019 Jerrykuku <jerrykuku@qq.com>
    https://github.com/jerrykuku/luci-theme-argon
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  * applications/luci-app-argon-config
    Copyright (C) Jerrykuku and contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The theme resources live under htdocs/luci-static/argon-plus/ and the
ucode templates under ucode/template/themes/argon-plus/, keeping every
path distinct from the upstream packages. The configuration UI is
mounted inline on the Language and Style page instead of a menu page.
